stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE : register (UC-01)
    ACTIVE --> LOCKED : Admin locks, sessions ended (UC-42, BR-05, BR-06)
    LOCKED --> ACTIVE : Admin unlocks (UC-42, BR-05)
    ACTIVE --> BANNED : Admin bans (UC-42) or moderation BAN_USER (UC-43), sessions ended (BR-06)
    LOCKED --> BANNED : Admin bans (UC-42, BR-06)
    BANNED --> [*] : permanent
